{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495995,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-20T02:01:59.174Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495995-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495995-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495995-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495995-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter uninstalling then re-adding the Vercel marketplace plugin on Grok Bot iOS, the plugin detail sheet stuck with a semi-transparent “Added” overlay. The X close control was visible but unresponsive; the rest of the app could not be interacted with until force-quitting Grok Bot from the iOS app switcher.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is distinct from Vercel OAuth redirect failures (Related: \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-vercel-plugin-649-oauth-fails-with-app-configuration-error-redirect-url-is-invalid/168499\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrok Bot: Vercel plugin (649) OAuth fails with “App configuration error – redirect URL is invalid”\u003c/a\u003e).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495995-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495995-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn Grok Bot iOS, uninstall the Vercel plugin.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRe-add / install Vercel from Plugins.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLand on the Vercel plugin detail sheet; observe “Added” pill/overlay.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTry X / dismiss / navigate elsewhere.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495995-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495995-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSheet dismisses; app remains interactive after install.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495995-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495995-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/6/36fd6a244b9550d3403cd3890febeca7e076ce57.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/7QsIKh3S8e9RkqxQ8YhxR7A8VLN.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"stuck-added.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/6/36fd6a244b9550d3403cd3890febeca7e076ce57_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"stuck-added.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"7QsIKh3S8e9RkqxQ8YhxR7A8VLN\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/6/36fd6a244b9550d3403cd3890febeca7e076ce57_2_231x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/6/36fd6a244b9550d3403cd3890febeca7e076ce57_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/6/36fd6a244b9550d3403cd3890febeca7e076ce57_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"222121\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003estuck-added.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1170×2532 154 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495995-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495995-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eiOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495995-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495995-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot: 1.11.1 (11669) · runtime d025c009e37d599fc420b10b990bf540e68ca7fc · embedded bundle · channel production\u003cbr\u003e\nBot name: (iOS — UI issue on Plugins / Vercel plugin sheet, not a specific agent tile)\u003cbr\u003e\nConversation ID: Gap — not provided (iOS has no right-click Copy Conversation ID)\u003cbr\u003e\nSurface: iOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495995-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495995-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMarketplace plugin: Vercel (catalog plugin, not hand-added MCP).\u003cbr\u003e\nWorkaround: force-quit Grok Bot from the iOS app switcher.\u003cbr\u003e\nIn-app SendFeedback also submitted for this report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495995-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495995-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-20T02:02:06.126Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":6,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":20.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172380,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-ios-vercel-plugin-sheet-stuck-on-added-after-uninstall-re-add-force-quit-required","display_username":"John Solly","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-vercel-plugin-649-oauth-fails-with-app-configuration-error-redirect-url-is-invalid/168499","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Grok Bot: Vercel plugin (649) OAuth fails with “App configuration error – redirect URL is invalid”","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":30025,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-ios-vercel-plugin-sheet-stuck-on-added-after-uninstall-re-add-force-quit-required/172380/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":496232,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-20T08:41:56.238Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jsolly\"\u003e@jsolly\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report, and for the screenshot!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt would help a lot to know whether this happens every time or was a one-off. Could you try these steps?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eForce-quit Grok Bot from the app switcher and reopen it.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGo to Plugins, open Your plugins, and tap Vercel.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTap the … menu in the top right of the sheet and choose Uninstall, then confirm.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStay on that same sheet and tap Add again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWait about 5 seconds after the button changes to “Added” without tapping anything.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDoes the sheet close on its own after step 5? If it gets stuck again, please reply with your exact iOS version (Settings \u0026gt; General \u0026gt; About) and whether the sheet also gets stuck when you add a plugin that was not just uninstalled (for example, uninstall Vercel, close the sheet, then open it again and tap Add).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the meantime, force-quitting and reopening the app is the way out if it happens again; the plugin itself is installed correctly on our side.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-20T08:41:56.238Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172380,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-ios-vercel-plugin-sheet-stuck-on-added-after-uninstall-re-add-force-quit-required","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-ios-vercel-plugin-sheet-stuck-on-added-after-uninstall-re-add-force-quit-required/172380/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[495995,496232]},"timelin